-- title:
--   Table-22 graded source and support-cover certificates
-- statement:
--   This bundle contains the exact ordered table of 140 saved source gradings, each on thirty coordinates, and two explicit bipartite support covers per grading. Each coordinate has two fixed integer filtration values and a recorded integer degree. The total allowed support consists of entries that strictly decrease the first coordinate, weakly decrease the second, and decrease degree by one. The mixed support additionally strictly decreases the second coordinate.
--
--   For each cover, the budget is the sum of the numbers of distinct selected target rows and source columns. Repeated list entries therefore do not inflate a budget. The finite validity predicate asks that every allowed entry be covered, that the degree array have length thirty, and that
--
--   $$
--   \min\{R,4+H\}\le13,\qquad \min\{R,2+H\}\le11.
--   $$
--
--   The certificate structure itself permits arbitrary finite arrays and cover lists; the separate theorem verifies all 140 bundled records. Array access is total, with default zero grades and an empty default certificate outside the stored bounds. The main theorem uses indices from zero through 139 and basis indices from zero through 29; the bundled lengths are checked.
--
--   These are literal data and a decidable support-checking interface, not an assumed rank bound, an enumeration-completeness theorem, a Floer invariant or a geometric realization.
-- source:
--   Ryan Shin, Table 22: a common-differential rank obstruction for Ui15/B1 and Ui15/G13, cycle12_table22_common_rank.md, Sections 2–4, equations (5)–(7); note SHA-256 04202f0649254279d91bad21875b82ddbd1a8fc8812454f5e3ca54b9c65b630e. Exact ordered records from cycle12_table22_common_rank.json, SHA-256 49ae9b38334cb89ff1eee916e4d96680850e02d51b493fd282f44181bd9c31ac. This contribution checks all 140 saved records and both rank bounds, not the unbounded source-enumeration or Floer/geometric completeness argument.

import Mathlib

set_option autoImplicit false

namespace SP4Table22

/-- A recorded source grading and two bipartite support covers. A source column
and a target row are separate cover vertices even when their numbers agree. -/
